<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ Treasury post election briefing papers- 4.00 pm.</title>
<headline>NZ Treasury post election briefing papers- 4.00 pm.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Treasury said on Thursday it would release its post-election briefing papers at 4.00 p.m.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
